    "summary": {
      "value": "Protector of apothecaries and teacher of purifying arts."
    },
    "data": {
      "merge": "<h3>Herbalist's Favor</h3><p>When you summon this Arcanum, you gain <strong>3 Medicine Points</strong>. When this Arcanum is dismissed, you lose all <strong>Medicine Points</strong>.</p><p>Once per turn during a conflict, you may perform the <strong>Skill</strong> action and spend <strong>1 Medicine Point</strong> to choose one ally you can see. If you do, that ally recovers an amount of Hit Points equal to your <strong>Crisis</strong> score and recovers from a single status effect of your choice.</p><hr><p><strong>You Gain:</strong> @PROGRESS[medicine-points update 3]{Gain 3 Medicine Points}</p><p><strong>You Spend:</strong> @PROGRESS[medicine-points update -1]{Spend 1 Medicine Point}<br><strong>Target Recovers:</strong> @GAIN[floor($mhp/2) hp]{Your Crisis HP}</p>",
      "pulse": "",
      "dismiss": "<h3>Cleansing Roots</h3><p>You deal 20 <strong>earth</strong> damage to every enemy you can see, or 30 <strong>earth</strong> damage if you had <strong>no Medicine Points</strong> left when you dismiss this Arcanum. Then, if one or more enemies that lost Hit Points this way are affected by one or more spells with a <strong>duration</strong> of \"Scene\", they stop being affected by those spells.</p><hr><p><strong>Enemies Suffer:</strong> @DMG[&step(20,30,40)+10*(1-min(1,&cs('medicine-points'))) earth]{20/30 Earth}<br><strong>You Lose:</strong> @PROGRESS[medicine-points reset]{Lose All Medicine Points}</p>",
      "domains": "exorcism, healing, plants",
      "type": "projectfu.arcanum",
      "enablePulse": false
    },
    "source": "FUBC32"
  },
